  "releaseNotes": "- Added internal snapshot support to CompanyList (Snapshot()), ensuring stable iteration even when the list is updated at runtime.\n\t\t  - Introduced an internal index (Dictionary(Of Guid, Company)) for fast lookups, improving GetCompany and enabling TryGetCompany.\n\t\t  - Implemented ReplaceAll(...) to atomically refresh the list, snapshot, and index in a single operation.\n\t\t  - Updated list mutation methods (Add, AddRange, Insert*, Remove*, Clear, etc.) to keep snapshot and index always synchronized.\n\t\t  - Adjusted Loaded handling to reflect whether the list actually contains companies.\n\t\t  - Nuget package update.",
